{"reference":"2 Samuel 20","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":20,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Larger Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel’s wider story moves from David’s accession and the consolidation of his kingdom through the ark and the promise to David’s dynasty, then into royal abuse, violence within his household, rebellion, and grief, before a four-part closing appendix. This chapter belongs within that later, troubled movement of the book.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_020_c3b1fc31001392788f3c41a9"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}